      "scope": "The Nevada Department of Education seeks a qualified vendor to provide a cloud-based, anonymous tip acquisition and management platform for the SafeVoice Nevada school safety initiative. The solution includes a secure web platform and branded iOS and Android apps for submitting anonymous tips (text, photo, audio, video) by web, app, or phone, with protected tipster identity. Required features include customizable tip workflows, duplicate detection, real-time email/SMS notifications, role-based access, audit trails, and custom reporting. The vendor must meet State security requirements (GovRAMP, SOC 2 Type II, 24-hour incident notification) and provide implementation, training, support, and a resource library over a four-year term. Please see cost schedule located in the attachments tab.",
